WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The <header> element holds the site name and the main navigation.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The <nav> element lists the five pages as links in a real list.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The <main> element wraps the content that is unique to this page.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The <article> element is a self-contained piece of content: here, the introduction.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The <aside> element carries related material: here, an outline of the page.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The <footer> element closes the page and links to the contact form.

